(7262541, 1129487, 170281, '<td valign="top">Dramatic and creative title.  The lighting makes it look like Heaven opened up to shine on these souls.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Dramatic and creative title.  The lighting makes it look like Heaven opened up to shine on these souls.  Very nicely done.', '2014-09-12 15:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
