(7263657, 1129509, 63218, '<td valign="top">Yes, but look at the 10s. I gave it a 10 myself. It is a shadow of a cat on a gossamer curtain &amp; the only reason you can see it is the cat is blocking the light. The room is full of shadows, too. And the color is wonderful. Don''t ever stop.</td>', 'Yes, but look at the 10s. I gave it a 10 myself. It is a shadow of a cat on a gossamer curtain & the only reason you can see it is the cat is blocking the light. The room is full of shadows, too. And the color is wonderful. Don''t ever stop.', '2014-09-17 02:09:38.000000', NULL, 0),
