(7263710, 1129509, 103142, '<td valign="top">I found this completely wonderful. I''m of the opinion that silhouettes, even though there''s a shadow component, really didn''t fit the challenge very well. (though they just got 4s, 5s, and 6s from me -- not troll votes, since there is a shadow component)<br/> <br/>That being said -- this was an 8 from me, and I''m kicking myself for not giving it a 9 or 10. This is so incredibly beautifully done. I could see this hanging in my family room. And I really wish it was a photo I had taken -- I''d be so incredibly proud of it.<br/> <br/>Instead of having the whole "it''s a silhouette, not really a shadow" thought -- I saw him more "hiding in the shadows". Just somehow, this one worked for me. And incredibly well.  My favorite shot in the challenge. And I need to go fav it now.</td>', 'I found this completely wonderful. I''m of the opinion that silhouettes, even though there''s a shadow component, really didn''t fit the challenge very well. (though they just got 4s, 5s, and 6s from me -- not troll votes, since there is a shadow component) That being said -- this was an 8 from me, and I''m kicking myself for not giving it a 9 or 10. This is so incredibly beautifully done. I could see this hanging in my family room. And I really wish it was a photo I had taken -- I''d be so incredibly proud of it. Instead of having the whole "it''s a silhouette, not really a shadow" thought -- I saw him more "hiding in the shadows". Just somehow, this one worked for me. And incredibly well.  My favorite shot in the challenge. And I need to go fav it now.', '2014-09-17 07:51:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7263711, 1129509, 103142, '<td valign="top">Btw, my husband just walked by, and said "Oh THAT is cool! That is a cool picture!" <br/> <br/></td>', 'Btw, my husband just walked by, and said "Oh THAT is cool! That is a cool picture!"  ', '2014-09-17 07:52:03.000000', NULL, 0),
