(7264052, 1129243, 77196, '<td valign="top">Bummer about the DQ. DPC takes their rule sets very seriously.<br/>On your profile page, you have the option to watermark your image with a copyright after voting, so it really isn''t necessary on the image itself. <br/>Voting is intended to be based on the image alone, and not influenced by who the photographer is - a copyright notice kind-of circumvents that.<br/>Don''t be discouraged. Enter often. Comment on others'' images a lot. This is a great place to learn and grow.</td>', 'Bummer about the DQ. DPC takes their rule sets very seriously.On your profile page, you have the option to watermark your image with a copyright after voting, so it really isn''t necessary on the image itself. Voting is intended to be based on the image alone, and not influenced by who the photographer is - a copyright notice kind-of circumvents that.Don''t be discouraged. Enter often. Comment on others'' images a lot. This is a great place to learn and grow.', '2014-09-18 10:38:38.000000', NULL, 0),
