(7281729, 1129297, 66267, '<td valign="top">wtf<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Beetle:</b></div><hr/><i> I had to google your title..... it is a drug..... still don''t get the REAL connection to "shadows". I see an good example for "framing" and b&amp;w.<br/>Since I am not into shoehorns, I will give this one a generous 4..... two of those points are for the mystery/mistery your image presents. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'wtf Originally posted by Beetle: I had to google your title..... it is a drug..... still don''t get the REAL connection to "shadows". I see an good example for "framing" and b&w.Since I am not into shoehorns, I will give this one a generous 4..... two of those points are for the mystery/mistery your image presents. ', '2014-11-07 14:35:57.000000', NULL, 0),
